	"name": "Slash Tendons",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/daggers/knife-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a reaction to a creature within reach making a melee attack against a creature that is not you, you may attempt to sever the tendons of the wrist, arm, tentacle, or other appendage making the attack. Make an opportunity attack, dealing damage as normal. The attacker must make a Constitution saving throw or lose the use of that attack option for 1 minute. On a successful save, the target is instead [[/condition id=rattled]] for 1 minute.</p>",
